---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Runtime errors | pre.style"
  description="What pre.style's production error numbers mean."
>
  <main>
    <h1>Runtime errors</h1>
    <p>
      To keep the runtime small, production builds of pre.style throw a number instead of a full
      message. Outside production builds, the same errors have full messages.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="/errors/1">Error 1</a>: a <code>{'${…}'}</code> value wasn't a string, a finite
        number, <code>null</code>, or <code>undefined</code>.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</Layout>
